All right, whose are they?

8
00:00:21,390 --> 00:00:23,520
Whose are they?

9
00:00:21,390 --> 00:00:23,520
Not mine.

10
00:00:23,770 --> 00:00:25,390
Joey's. Got to be Joey's.

11
00:00:30,230 --> 00:00:31,280
They're mine.

12
00:00:31,530 --> 00:00:34,360
See, Joey's. They're Joe-Joe-Joey's.

13
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:36,450
Why are they here?

14
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:38,700
I don't know, uh...

15
00:00:40,990 --> 00:00:42,450
I'm Joey.

16
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:44,580
I'm disgusting.

17
00:00:44,790 --> 00:00:47,540
I take my underwear off in other people's homes.

18
00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:52,250
Get them out of here. What's wrong with you?

19
00:00:52,420 --> 00:00:53,460
Yeah.

20
00:00:52,420 --> 00:00:53,460
Yeah.

21
00:00:56,130 --> 00:00:58,140
Take them!

22
00:00:56,130 --> 00:00:58,140
I got them.

23
