You can touch them. They're yours.

24
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:08,310
Chandler? A word?

25
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:09,900
Yeah.

26
00:01:16,650 --> 00:01:21,160
I'm tired of covering for you two. This has got to stop. Aah.

27
00:01:22,700 --> 00:01:24,910
Tighty-whiteys? What are you, 8?

28
