Yesterday, Rachel found your razor in our bathroom.

32
00:01:38,300 --> 00:01:42,430
I said it was mine, and that I was playing a woman in a play.

33
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:46,480
Then one thing led to another and...

34
00:01:51,980 --> 00:01:54,940
And around the ankles, that is a tough spot.

35
00:01:55,190 --> 00:01:56,860
It was. All right, listen...

36
00:01:57,110 --> 00:01:59,530
All this lying has been hard on us too.

37
00:01:59,780 --> 00:02:02,320
Yeah, I bet all the sex makes it easier.

38
00:02:04,160 --> 00:02:05,740
Yeah, actually.

39
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:08,500
We'll be more careful.

40
00:02:08,750 --> 00:02:12,670
We don't want them to know, because it's going really well.

41
00:02:13,380 --> 00:02:16,460
And maybe it's going well because it's a secret.

42
00:02:16,710 --> 00:02:20,220
It sounds weird, but we're so bad at relationships.

43
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:22,510
We are. Help us.

44
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:22,510
Help.

45
00:02:24,430 --> 00:02:28,100
All right. But you do it with me once.

46
00:02:32,150 --> 00:02:33,190
Joey!

47
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:34,520
Didn't think so.

48
00:03:26,870 --> 00:03:28,790
Hey, Phoebe.

49
00:03:26,870 --> 00:03:28,790
Hey, Pheebs.

50
00:03:28,950 --> 00:03:30,080
What are you reading?

51
00:03:30,250 --> 00:03:31,790
Um, Wuthering Heights.

52
