234
00:13:43,110 --> 00:13:46,650
I was going to, but I, uh, accidentally read something else.

235
00:13:46,820 --> 00:13:48,660
What?

236
00:13:46,820 --> 00:13:48,660
Vogue.

237
00:13:50,620 --> 00:13:52,450
So tell me about Jane Eyre.

238
00:13:52,700 --> 00:13:54,200
No, read it yourself.

239
00:13:54,450 --> 00:13:57,290
Come on, don't be such a goody-goody.

240
00:13:58,250 --> 00:13:59,500
Fine.

241
00:14:01,170 --> 00:14:02,840
All right. So Jane Eyre?

242
00:14:03,090 --> 00:14:05,760
First you'd think she's a woman, but she's not.

243
00:14:05,970 --> 00:14:07,340
She's a cyborg.

244
00:14:09,930 --> 00:14:12,300
A cyborg? Isn't that like a robot?

245
00:14:13,350 --> 00:14:16,310
This book was light years ahead of its time.

246
00:14:18,350 --> 00:14:20,310
Sorry I'm late. Let's get started.

247
00:14:20,860 --> 00:14:23,980
What did you think of Jane Eyre?

248
00:14:24,150 --> 00:14:29,400
Um, Rachel and I were discussing it, and she had very interesting insights.

249
00:14:30,660 --> 00:14:32,120
Go ahead, Rachel.

250
00:14:32,410 --> 00:14:34,740
Um, thank you, Phoebe.

251
00:14:36,870 --> 00:14:39,960
What struck me most when reading Jane Eyre...

252
00:14:40,170 --> 00:14:43,330
...was, uh, how the book was so ahead of its time.

253
00:14:43,590 --> 00:14:47,340
If you're talking about feminism, I think you're right.

254
00:14:49,380 --> 00:14:52,890
Well, feminism, yes. But also the robots.

255
00:14:57,560 --> 00:14:59,140
Hey.

256
00:14:57,560 --> 00:14:59,140
Hey.

257
00:15:00,900 --> 00:15:03,730
Since that video camera thing didn't work out...

258
00:15:04,650 --> 00:15:08,940
...I thought that I would give you just a little preview.

259
00:15:10,400 --> 00:15:11,780
You're naked!

260
00:15:12,030 --> 00:15:13,070
I know!

261
00:15:24,420 --> 00:15:25,460
Ross?

262
00:15:26,920 --> 00:15:28,710
Hey, Chandler.

263
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:31,090
Monica!

264
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:33,090
Are you okay?

265
00:15:33,340 --> 00:15:34,720
I'm fine.

266
00:15:34,970 --> 00:15:37,640
I saw a psychiatrist at work today.

267
00:15:37,930 --> 00:15:39,060
Why?

268
00:15:39,350 --> 00:15:41,270
On account of my rage.

269
00:15:42,390 --> 00:15:46,060
Which, if I may say, right now is out of control.

270
00:15:46,940 --> 00:15:49,650
He gave me a pill for it.

271
00:15:51,030 --> 00:15:52,360
A pill?

272
00:15:52,530 --> 00:15:55,870
Uh-huh. When the psychiatrist told me to take a leave of absence...

